; manuals (CP/M 2.20, (C) 1980) and are authoritative: S&HD = "Software and Hardware
; Details", CPMREF = the bundled Digital Research CP/M 2.2 Reference Manual. See the
; consolidated fact sheet at ../../docs/CPM_Manual_Reconcile_Facts.md. The function
